Integrating Redis Streams into your Node.js microservices stack unlocks scalable, fault-tolerant, and decoupled asynchronous messaging without the operational burden of heavy brokers. By leveraging TypeScript, `ioredis`, and robust consumer group patterns, you can build enterprise-grade architectures capable of handling high-throughput event flows efficiently.

